<a name="con"><h2>CONSTRUCTION</h2></a>

[ <a href="http://www.metacafe.com/watch/912594/simple_electric_generator/">
SHORT VIDEO 2.5 min</a> ]
<br>
[ <a href="http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k7Sz8oT8ou0">LONGER VIDEO, 8 min.
</a> ]
<br><p>
<br><p>


First make the hollow-ended box.  Score the cardboard strip like so:

</font>
<font size=3><pre>


